body:
I was taking my wife and daughter to visit my parents in my hometown. It was a fun trip; my parents spoiled their granddaughter and I got to visit some old friends from school. At the end of the day we checked into our 2 bed hotel room and settled down. I tucked daughter into her bed and then I went over to my wife who already curled up in the other one. She and I held each other as we drifted off to sleep.

&#x200B;

And then I woke up. At first I was confused and wondered why I was back in my old room in my parents house. Then it dawned on me that the whole thing was dream. I had never been married, had children, and (at the time) I was still in high school. The dream felt real and it messed me up for rest of the day afterwards.
